  "interpretation": {
    "scores_are_calibrated_probabilities": false,
    "intended_role_in_arboris": "Visual candidate generator, not final species identifier.",
    "main_observed_limitation": "Quillaja saponaria showed strong systematic confusion, especially with Cryptocarya alba and Lithraea caustica.",
    "architectural_conclusion": "BioCLIP candidates should be combined with botanical characters, adaptive key logic, context and explicit uncertainty."
